{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017113153144-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017114400\"/><p>現場冒出大量濃煙。</p><p>昂船洲有船隻起火。今日(17日)早上9時53分，昂運路5號對開一艘已泊岸船隻發生火警，船上雜物起火冒出大量濃煙，消防人員接報到場正進行滅火行動。同時作出呼籲，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請盡量留在室內及關閉門窗，並保持鎮定。人員正調查起火原因。事件中，無人受傷、亦毋須疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T03:59:23.637914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:31:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:36.133672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:36.133672+00:00","content_hash":"36cfd9c00866366b8578af23e8cf907885092842ad89a545fa44680fffd6b898","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}